  "rationale": "Container logs show 81% throttling (29,160/36,000 periods) despite metrics reporting 6% throttledRatio, suggesting the new version uses more CPU. Raising the limit would address this without rolling back, as earlier_revision_healthy is true and throttling_came_with_rollout is unknown but likely true based on logs.",
